{"step_index":163,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:05:55Z","thinking":"The search for \"모두싸인\" yielded no results, despite a previous finding of `/article/3568700243`. The discrepancy requires investigation into the regex pattern used in the search function versus what is actually present in the HTML. The regex search in the test script, confirmed a pattern of `/article/\\d+`, which needs comparison with the HTML content.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import urllib.request\nimport urllib.parse\nimport re\n\nurl = f\"https://bizno.net/?query={urllib.parse.quote('모두싸인')}\"\nheaders = {\n    \"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\"\n}\nreq = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers)\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\n    html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n\nprint(\"Length:\", len(html))\n# Extract all links with /article/\\d+ and the surrounding text\nmatches = re.findall(r'<a\\s+[^>]*href=[\"\\'](/article/(\\d+))[\"\\'][^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)</a>', html)\nprint(\"Matches:\", len(matches))\nfor m in matches[:5]:\n    print(m[1], re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', ' ', m[2]).strip())\n","Description":"Check matching pattern for bizno","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\scratch\\debug_bizno_regex.py","toolAction":"Debugging bizno regex","toolSummary":"Debug bizno search regex"}}]}
