{"step_index":168,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:06:03Z","thinking":"User has explicitly approved proceeding. The target is `\"C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\Today\\(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_`. I am executing the task.\n\n\nInitial approach involves constructing a Python search engine to query various data sources for missing business registration information. The primary data source will be Bizno, utilizing company name and potentially cleaned telephone numbers for searches. I'll need to handle variations in company names (e.g., \"(주)\", \"주식회사\") to maximize search accuracy. After finding data with bizno, I have to ensure the data I get from bizno is most accurate by cross-referencing with other available sources.\n\n\nThe initial step involves querying Bizno with the company name, parsing the results to extract business registration numbers (biz_no), names, and addresses. For each candidate found, the detailed Bizno page is fetched to retrieve additional information such as CEO, establishment date, current status, full address, employee count, and telephone number. This information will be used to verify matches against the target.\nIf the Bizno search is unsuccessful or requires cross-checking, I will use web searches, including Google, Naver Map, and Kakao Map, with different query combinations. These queries will include the company name with \"부산\", and relevant keywords for business information. I will also use the company name with phone number, or address.\nI will consider a match based on address details (including \"부산\", target sigungu, dong, and building), representative name, phone number, and distinct company name with a Busan address. The objective is to find the most accurate business information and cross-validate across multiple sources.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import urllib.request\nimport urllib.parse\nimport re\nimport json\n\ndef parse_bizno_article(biz_no_10):\n    url = f\"https://bizno.net/article/{biz_no_10}\"\n    headers = {\n        \"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\"\n    }\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers)\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n            \n            # The meta description or table has the summary\n            # Example: <meta name=\"description\" content=\"...\">\n            desc_match = re.search(r'<meta\\s+name=[\"\\']description[\"\\']\\s+content=[\"\\'](.*?)[\"\\']', html)\n            desc = desc_match.group(1) if desc_match else \"\"\n            \n            # Parse fields from desc or html table\n            # 대표자명 : (\\S+)\n            ceo_match = re.search(r'대표자명\\s*:\\s*([^\\s<]+)', desc) or re.search(r'대표자명\\s*</th>\\s*<td[^>]*>(.*?)</td>', html)\n            ceo = ceo_match.group(1).strip() if ceo_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 설립일(신고/인허가일) : (\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})\n            est_match = re.search(r'설립일[^\\:]*:\\s*(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})', desc) or re.search(r'설립일[^\\:]*</th>\\s*<td[^>]*>(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})', html)\n            est_year = est_match.group(1) if est_match else \"\"\n            est_month = str(int(est_match.group(2))) if est_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 종업원수 : (\\d+)명\n            emp_match = re.search(r'종업원수\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)명', desc) or re.search(r'종업원수\\s*</th>\\s*<td[^>]*>(\\d+)명', html)\n            emp_cnt = emp_match.group(1) if emp_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 사업자등록번호 : (\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5})\n            biz_match = re.search(r'사업자등록번호\\s*:\\s*(\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5})', desc) or re.search(r'사업자등록번호\\s*</th>\\s*<td[^>]*>(\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5})', html)\n            biz_no_fmt = biz_match.group(1) if biz_match else f\"{biz_no_10[:3]}-{biz_no_10[3:5]}-{biz_no_10[5:]}\"\n            \n            # 사업자 현재 상태\n            status_match = re.search(r'사업자 현재 상태[^\\:]*:\\s*([^\\s<]+)', desc)\n            status = status_match.group(1) if status_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 폐업일자 if any\n            closed_date_match = re.search(r'폐업일자\\s*:\\s*(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})', html) or re.search(r'폐업\\s*일자\\s*:\\s*(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})', desc)\n            closed_date = closed_date_match.group(1) if closed_date_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 주소\n            addr_match = re.search(r'소재지\\s*</th>\\s*<td[^>]*>(.*?)</td>', html) or re.search(r'주소\\s*</th>\\s*<td[^>]*>(.*?)</td>', html)\n            addr = re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', ' ', addr_match.group(1)).strip() if addr_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 회사명\n            title_match = re.search(r'<title>(.*?)</title>', html)\n            title = title_match.group(1).replace(\"- 비즈노\", \"\").strip() if title_match else \"\"\n            \n            return {\n                \"biz_no_10\": biz_no_10,\n                \"biz_no\": biz_no_fmt,\n                \"title\": title,\n                \"ceo\": ceo,\n                \"est_year\": est_year,\n                \"est_month\": est_month,\n                \"emp_cnt\": emp_cnt,\n                \"status\": status,\n                \"closed_date\": closed_date,\n                \"addr\": addr,\n                \"desc\": desc\n            }\n    except Exception as e:\n        return {\"error\": str(e)}\n\nres = parse_bizno_article(\"3568700243\")\nprint(\"모두싸인:\", json.dumps(res, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n\nres2 = parse_bizno_article(\"2438601731\")\nprint(\"아이티에프씨:\", json.dumps(res2, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n","Description":"Test parsing Bizno article page details","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\scratch\\test_parse_article.py","toolAction":"Writing article parser test","toolSummary":"Test Bizno article details parsing"}}]}
