{"step_index":182,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:06:34Z","thinking":"Bizno search functionality appears to vary; some addresses are hidden or require payment, yet the target Excel file contains address data for row 2260. Other data fields like business registration number, CEO, establishment date, and employee count have been successfully retrieved from Bizno. The aim is to understand the Bizno search behavior to determine how to proceed with the data extraction.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import urllib.request\nimport urllib.parse\n\ndef check_query(q):\n    url = f\"https://bizno.net/?query={urllib.parse.quote(q)}\"\n    headers = {\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0\"}\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers)\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\n        html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n    print(f\"Query '{q}': len={len(html)}\")\n    if \"검색결과가 없습니다\" in html or \"결과가 없습니다\" in html:\n        print(\"  -> No results message found\")\n    with open(rf\"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\scratch\\bizno_raw_{q}.html\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(html)\n\ncheck_query(\"꿈해몽\")\ncheck_query(\"나래바람\")\ncheck_query(\"도서출판일광\")\n","Description":"Check raw search results on Bizno","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\scratch\\check_queries.py","toolAction":"Checking raw search results","toolSummary":"Check Bizno queries"}}]}
